WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:25.060
Jonouchi!

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:28.650
How dirty!  Let Anzu go!

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.340
Jonouchi!  Namu!

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:41.340
That's...

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:45.830
Mokuba!

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.720
Thanks for coming.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:54.530
We're Ghouls's assassins.  I'm Mask of Light.

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:56.830
I'm Mask of Darkness.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:01.770
We formed this tag team specifically to hunt for God Cards.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:04.770
Shining Abyss in defense position!

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:09.580
The spell card Mask of Brutality!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:20.120
What?  He has a monster with over 2000 attack points on the first turn!

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:24.840
They're confident because they have a strategy for this tag duel.

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:29.100
But Kaiba wants to fight alone.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:34.130
Under these circumstances, how will I be able to save my friends?

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:40.540
God Cards Sealed Away

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:07.470
It's my turn.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:11.520
My card is...

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:14.330
Mask of the Accursed.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.070
Mask of the Accursed?

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:18.270
Here's what I'll do.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:22.310
I equip it on Yugi's Magnet Warrior.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:30.960
The monster wearing that mask can't attack or defend.

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:38.130
And the monster's owner takes 500 points of damage every time it's his turn.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:44.540
I set a card and end my turn.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.310
Is it a trap card?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.420
Mask of Light hasn't played a monster card.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:54.650
His strategy is to use Mask Cards to seal away our monsters' abilities.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.050
My partner's powerful monsters will finish you.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:03.050
Yugi, it's your turn.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:07.360
You lose 500 life points.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:11.260
I draw!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.840
Archfiend of Gilfer.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:19.140
It's a Level 6 monster that has an effect.

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:28.910
Mask of the Accursed prevents Yugi's monster from attacking or defending, but he can still tribute it.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:32.650
If I was him, I'd tribute it to summon a higher Level monster.

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:36.920
But I have a bad feeling about this.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:43.200
Fine.  I tribute Magnet Warrior-

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.670
I activate a trap card!

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:49.640
The Continuous Trap, Mask of Restrict!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:50.230
What?

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.240
I trapped you!

00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:02.580
Mask of Restrict is a trap card that stops all tributing.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:09.340
As long as this Continuous Trap Card is on the field, you're not allowed to tribute your monsters.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:10.220
What?

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:14.590
We can't summon our high Level monsters!

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:22.120
So even though you have God Cards, you can't summon them if you can't tribute.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:24.040
The God Cards are sealed away!

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:25.470
You...

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:29.930
We can only summon up to Level 4 monsters.

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:34.890
I set a card and bring out Kuriboh in defense position.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.170
I end my turn.

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:41.070
If we can't Tribute Summon, we can't win.

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:45.040
Kaiba, there's only one way we can win.

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:47.530
I know what you want to say.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:50.260
You want us to work together.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:53.760
How dumb.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.100
Kaiba...

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:57.770
It's no good.  He won't change his mind.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.170
My turn!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:08.400
I should leave Yugi's Magnet Warrior on the field because it'll reduce his life points.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.800
I'm worried about Kaiba's set card.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:16.640
Don't worry, partner.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:19.290
Okay.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.410
First, I set a card!

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.960
Then Shining Abyss attacks Kaiba's Vorse Raider!

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:30.470
I won't let you!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.840
I activate the trap Ring of Destruction!

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:33.840
Nice!

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:39.180
This card destroys Shining Abyss.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:45.680
And we both take damage equal to its attack points, so we take 2600 points of damage.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.700
That's not going to happen.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:49.740
I activate my Counter Trap Card!

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:50.420
What?

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.520
Curse Transfer.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:57.770
Curse Transfer activates when you play a trap card.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:01.030
Your trap's effect switches back to you.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:10.530
But Kaiba won't be the only one taking damage.  Mask of Darkness will too...

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:13.280
Kaiba, they're up to something!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.000
Be quiet, Yugi!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.600
I know what's going on.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:18.180
I don't need your advice!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.120
Vorse Raider is destroyed!

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:26.120
The spell card Ring of Defense!

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:30.130
This card negates damage from a trap.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:32.960
How's that?

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:34.440
You fool.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:37.900
That's not good enough to break our tag combo.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:38.900
What?

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:42.670
Your effect switches to me!

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:47.210
Kaiba, Ring of Defense's effect is gone!

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:50.450
It comes to my side and protects me from damage!

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:54.780
Kaiba...

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:59.150
This is Light and Darkness's joint strategy.

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:02.790
You two cannot defeat our teamwork.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:06.820
Shining Abyss, attack Kaiba directly!

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.510
Die, Kaiba!

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.370
Umm...

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:33.360
Hello.

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:37.090
Big brother?

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:39.730
It's me.  Honda.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:40.970
Honda!

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:43.700
You can't remove your bandages yet?

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:46.550
They say I can, but...

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:49.600
Then let's go to Battle City after you remove your bandages.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:51.270
Yes, but...

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:52.570
But what?

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:56.480
My brother was with me during the operation.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:02.220
So I want to remove my bandages in front of him.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:05.150
You feel nervous without Jonouchi?

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:11.400
Okay!  Let's go find Jonouchi.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.250
We'll root for Jonouchi together.

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.570
He'll give you the courage.

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:18.800
Thank you, Honda.

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:22.350
Actually, you might give him courage instead.

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:24.810
Well, you can count on me.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.080
I'll take you to him.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:35.250
The anesthesia is working.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.590
He's sound asleep.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:40.980
Who would do something so horrible to him?

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:47.780
Since the only witness is sleeping right here, we can't search for the culprit.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:56.810
Hey!  Unhand me!

00:09:57.170 --> 00:10:00.610
Do you think you can get away with this?

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:08.780
Wait!  What are you going to do with me?

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:11.790
Where did you take Jonouchi and Namu?

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.440
Hey!

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:21.860
What are the Ghouls going to do?

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:27.220
Even if they capture us, we don't have any rare cards.

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:33.340
This Millennium Necklace has the power to see the near future.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:37.080
That's how I knew you were coming here.

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:41.180
And that a new battle will begin.

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:47.760
Yes, by coming here of your own free will, your destiny is to battle.

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:53.640
When Ishizu spoke about a new battle, she wasn't just talking about a game.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:57.800
She was talking about the other Yugi's battle.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:04.170
We've been dragged into this battle without knowing it.

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:14.220
What?

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:15.980
Yugi...

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:20.740
I activated the spell Multiply on Kuriboh.

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:24.080
It's a combo between Kuriboh and Multiply!

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:27.560
Your attack doesn't reach Kaiba!

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:31.070
A wall of weak monsters?

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:33.130
What a joke!

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:36.570
Your Kuriboh saved me?

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.980
Yugi, that was unnecessary!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:44.680
Kaiba, this tag duel continues until both players on a team are defeated.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:50.790
But if one of us loses, then we'll both be defeated.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:53.960
You think I can't win on my own?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:58.790
The combination of those two Ghouls is perfect.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:04.550
They support each other, so their teamwork creates perfect attacks.

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:10.270
We can't defeat those Ghouls unless we work together!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:12.000
Work together...

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:18.280
Your horrible teamwork will never defeat us.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:25.910
But our attacks won't reach them if they have lots of those weak monsters.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:27.290
What a nuisance.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:30.790
Don't worry.  I have a plan.

00:12:57.850 --> 00:12:58.820
Almost there...

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:08.650
Ouch...

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.800
I should've gone on a diet.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.220
Let me go!

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:15.750
What are you doing?

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:22.550
Mokuba?

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:23.710
Anzu?

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.350
Are you okay?

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:26.720
Yeah.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.760
Why are you here?

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:34.130
I was searching for you when suddenly...

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:36.760
Jonouchi and I were attacked too.

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:38.260
Why is this happening?

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:43.930
They captured us to make sure Yugi and my brother would duel.

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:49.000
The Ghouls are trying to take the God Cards from my brother and Yugi.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:50.600
God Cards?

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:55.400
Yeah.  The three God Cards are legendary rare cards.

00:13:55.400 --> 00:14:00.610
My brother and Yugi have one each, and the Ghouls want them.

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:03.840
I see.  But I think there's more to it.

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:06.200
You know something, Anzu?

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.360
No, it's just a feeling.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:14.170
Even if I told him, Mokuba wouldn't understand.

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:20.320
That we're involved in a fight that started thousand of years ago in ancient Egypt.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:30.780
My turn!

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:31.610
I draw!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.240
Blue-Eyes...

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:41.700
I can't summon this Level 8 monster unless I tribute two monsters.

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:48.620
But they have the Continuous Spell Card Mask of Restrict on their field.

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:53.830
I can't summon Blue-Eyes, much less my God Card.

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:00.140
I have no choice.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.710
I set a card.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.060
I summon Battle Ox in defense position.

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.200
I end my turn.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:12.890
It takes all you effort to defend yourself, Kaiba.

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:18.390
They have Shining Abyss with 2600 attack points on their field.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:23.940
In a tag duel, your monster is allowed to defend your partner.

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:27.700
We have to survive using this Kuriboh wall for now.

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:30.640
Until we get a chance.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.970
My turn.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:36.300
What a swarm of monsters.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:40.480
You can't do anything while hiding behind those weaklings.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:43.690
I'll clean them up with my card.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:47.200
The mask card, Mask of Dispel!

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:48.980
What?

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:58.260
The spell card Multiply is wearing a mask!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.910
It stops Multiply's effect, so I only have one Kuriboh.

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:19.960
And due to this Mask's curse, you lose 500 life points during each of your turns.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.100
We lost our wall.

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:27.930
It's only a matter of time until their monsters attack us directly.

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:29.320
What can we do?

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:34.680
Next, Grand Tiki Elder attacks Kuriboh!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.340
Killer Thought!

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:54.320
Your defending monster is gone.

00:16:54.720 --> 00:17:00.060
Due to Mask of the Accursed, my Magnet Warrior can't attack or defend.

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:03.370
I have no other monsters to defend with.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:06.120
Yugi, it's your turn.

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:11.090
And don't forget that you lose 1000 life points.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.000
My turn.

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:20.910
I draw!

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.050
A trap card...

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:27.650
I still have a chance.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:31.600
If I use the spell card Card Destruction...

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:37.310
...all players must discard their hands and then draw the same number they discarded.

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.060
But...

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:46.250
If Kaiba has a card in his hand that can turn the tables, I'll be forcing him to discard it.

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:53.360
I can't do it.  I can't risk worsening our teamwork.

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:56.680
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:02.000
It seems you don't have any Level 4-or-lower monsters in your hand.

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:05.760
That means you can't summon a monster this turn.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:11.060
It's unfortunate that you only have high Level monsters in your hand.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:15.000
Cards that can't be summoned without tributing are worthless.

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:17.500
Bury them in the graveyard.

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.000
Kaiba's set card...

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.930
I see.  He's sending me a message.

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:29.300
They're having an argument.

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:32.990
They never had teamwork to begin with.

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:35.450
Yugi, did you get my message?

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:38.520
I set a card.

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:40.760
I end my turn.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:46.050
Yugi, you've run out of monsters to summon in defense position.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.900
I'm taking a gamble!

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.470
My turn!

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:54.610
I'll use this spell card!

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:57.540
The Ritual Card, Curse of the Masked Beast!

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.450
Masked Beast?

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:05.640
My partner and I each tribute a monster on our fields.

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:18.860
I summon The Masked Beast!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.870
3200 attack points!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:25.630
Yugi doesn't have a monster to defend with.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:28.540
The Masked Beast, kill Yugi!

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:43.620
What?  Kaiba's monster took the hit?

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:53.560
Under tag duel rules, when my teammate is attacked directly, my monster is allowed to block the attack.

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:54.500
Remember?

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:59.370
I thought they didn't have any teamwork.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:00.440
Kaiba!

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:02.970
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:05.680
I'm only playing you back for Kuriboh.

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:12.090
But Kaiba no longer has a monster.

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:17.360
You're powerless against The Masked Beast's attack points!

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.600
Are you sure?

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:21.400
Let's go, Kaiba!

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.520
I flip over my set card!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.620
Card Destruction!

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:25.580
What?

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.200
Card Destruction?

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:30.540
All players must discard their hands.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:35.020
Archfiend of Gilfer goes from my hand to the graveyard.

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:46.680
I also discard my entire hand.

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:53.930
Tributes are required to summon high Level monsters.

00:20:54.260 --> 00:21:00.100
But there's a way to bring a monster to the field without tributing.

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:02.700
My turn!

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:05.840
I flip over my set card!

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:07.540
Monster Reborn!

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:14.150
That's...

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:15.340
Kaiba!

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:20.720
Card Destruction sent Blue-Eyes to the graveyard, but I now revive it!

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:22.450
Blue-Eyes!

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:26.780
Blue-Eyes White Dragon revives!

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:47.600
Kaiba manages to summon Blue-Eyes, but the Rare Hunters' monster has more attack points.

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:50.800
What?  You still want it to attack, Yugi?

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:55.300
I see!  You want to show Kaiba the power of teamwork!

00:21:55.300 --> 00:22:00.260
If you two can work together, the Rare Hunters' combo moves aren't scary at all!

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:02.190
Make a comeback!

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:04.530
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Unite!

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:06.530
Duel, standby!

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:26.070
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:31.440
I feel like I've been here

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:41.090
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:41.400 --> 00:22:52.600
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:55.490 --> 00:23:00.130
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:00.790 --> 00:23:05.410
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:05.960 --> 00:23:10.510
Will never change

00:23:11.170 --> 00:23:15.780
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:20.990
To be who I am

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:26.230
I've kept searching for something

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:30.930
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.870
I learned that's the answer

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:40.970
From now until forever...
